# `.llm-wiki/` IS committed, since 19/08/2026. It held only site decisions and design notes by
# then, and this repository is not the one it was excluded from.
#
# THIS FILE SHIPS to the public repository, so the reasoning is deliberately not here: it is in
# the internal instructions file at the root of this directory, under the Wiki heading, together
# with the two premises of the original rule and the dates each stopped being true. The struck
# original is at `.llm-wiki/decisions/decision-gitignore-wiki.md`.
#
# Removed rather than negated. A negation does work here, tested rather than assumed, but it
# leaves two rules cancelling each other and the next person to tidy the file has a 50% chance of
# deleting the wrong one.
# build output
dist/
# generated types
.astro/

# dependencies
node_modules/

# logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*


# environment variables
.env
.env.production

# macOS-specific files
.DS_Store

# jetbrains setting folder
.idea/

# mise local overrides
mise.local.toml


# the agent layer's Python environment
agents/.venv/
agents/**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# playwright
test-results/
playwright-report/
